PLR1722 [*] Use `sys.exit()` instead of `exit`
 --> sys_exit_alias_19.py:5:5
  |
4 | if cond:
5 |     exit(1)
  |     ^^^^
  |
help: Replace `exit` with `sys.exit()`
  |
